cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PACE, cite this repository and the exact Git commit used."
type: software
title: "PACE: Prior-Anchored Contact Estimation"
version: 0.12.4
authors:
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Linyong
    affiliation: Northwest A&F University
repository-code: https://github.com/shenlinyong/PACE
url: https://github.com/shenlinyong/PACE
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Enhancer-gene prediction with the Activity-by-Contact score, with contact
  estimated from low-depth, low-resolution or surrogate-tissue Hi-C through a
  distance-boundary prior fitted on Hi-C, promoter-activity weighting of
  alternative TSSs and explicit missing-data handling.
keywords:
  - enhancer-gene regulation
  - genomics
  - research software
